{"id":"vod_lz_82249","vodId":"82249","provider":"lz","providerName":"量子资源","type":2,"name":"来自风平浪静的明天","name_cn":"来自风平浪静的明天","date":"2013-01-01","year":"2013","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://img.lzipic.com/upload/vod/20240205-1/9ce93d6999c6db01c427393d8b42b4a2.jpg"},"summary":"因为所在的波路中学倒闭，新学期一开始，先岛光（花江夏树 配音）和青梅竹马向井户爱花（花泽香菜 配音）以及好友比良平千咲（茅野爱衣 配音）、伊佐木要（逢坂良太 配音）转校至位于陆地的美滨中学继续学业。先岛和朋友们是生活在海底的海之民，传说很久以前人类全部始于大海，大有一部分人迷恋陆地的生活，而放弃了神赐予的“胞衣”。千百年来，陆之民和海之民在摩擦中共存，他们之间有矛盾，有误会，也有憧憬和向往。在新的学校，先岛和爱花结识了生活在海边的少年木原纺（石川界人 饰）。　　来自不同的种族，少男少女别样的青春故事就此上演……","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2024-02-05 00:29:04","playable":true,"episodeCount":26,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"lzm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v.cdnlz19.com/20240203/12409_29a5cad8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v.cdnlz19.com/20240203/12411_9e234a19/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v.cdnlz19.com/20240203/12410_308dd9f2/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v.cdnlz19.com/20240203/12413_a221848a/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v.cdnlz19.com/20240203/12412_9d35e696/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v.cdnlz19.com/20240203/12414_d078f9dc/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v.cdnlz19.com/20240203/12415_e5af6820/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v.cdnlz19.com/20240203/12416_10a98d18/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v.cdnlz19.com/20240203/12417_826816fc/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v.cdnlz19.com/20240203/12418_6b7f47af/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v.cdnlz19.com/20240203/12420_3e33512d/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v.cdnlz19.com/20240203/12419_ec5f4191/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v.cdnlz19.com/20240203/12421_9bce5028/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v.cdnlz19.com/20240203/12422_3a4b17d7/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://v.cdnlz19.com/20240203/12423_05930115/index